    "outlook": "The Indian market witnessed a largely flat closing, with NIFTY 50 and SENSEX posting marginal gains. Banking and Metal sectors provided support, while IT and FMCG lagged. FIIs were net sellers, though DII buying significantly absorbed the selling pressure.",
